license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/somphol/khan-trig-unit4-equations-identities-studio"
url: "https://somphol.github.io/khan-trig-unit4-equations-identities-studio/"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, bilingual (English and Thai) interactive companion for
  Khan Academy Trigonometry Unit 4. Three canvas studios cover inverse
  trigonometric functions with restricted domains, Pythagorean identity
  simplification with geometric area models, and trigonometric equations with
  multiple solutions, plus identity proofs, streaks and badges. The site runs
  entirely in the browser and stores progress locally.
keywords:
  - trigonometry
  - inverse trigonometric functions
  - principal value
  - Pythagorean identities
  - trigonometric equations
  - unit circle
  - mathematics education
  - interactive learning
  - bilingual education
  - Thai
  - HTML5 Canvas
